@guide A_WesternPlaguelands
@name Western Plaguelands (Chillwind Camp)
@faction Alliance
@levels 55-57
@zone Western Plaguelands
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Chillwind Camp: the Scourge cauldron chain (four cauldrons, a return to camp after each), Andorhal's watchtowers and Chromie, the Felstone and Dalson farms, the wildlife quests and the Scarlet Crusade in the north. Then on to the Eastern Plaguelands.
@next Both_EasternPlaguelands

accept 5090 A Call to Arms: The Plaguelands! [zone=Ironforge] | Courier Hammerfall walks around Ironforge (Crier Goodman in Stormwind has the same quest). Needed for the Chillwind Camp chain.
fp Chillwind Camp
turnin 5090 A Call to Arms: The Plaguelands! | Commander Ashlam Valorfist, Chillwind Camp.
accept Clear the Way
accept A Plague Upon Thee | Nathaniel Dumah, Chillwind Camp.
accept The Wildlife Suffers Too | Mulgris Deepriver.
accept Unfinished Business | Kirsta Deepshadow. The Scarlet camps are in the north; this is done last.
complete Clear the Way | Skeletal Flayers and Slavering Ghouls in the Felstone Field.
accept Better Late Than Never | Janice Felstone at the Felstone Field farmhouse.
complete Better Late Than Never
turnin Better Late Than Never
accept 5022 Better Late Than Never
turnin 5022 Better Late Than Never | Turned in at Stormwind City.
complete A Plague Upon Thee | Termite barrels in the farms.
complete The Wildlife Suffers Too | Diseased wolves around the farms.
turnin Clear the Way | Chillwind Camp.
accept The Scourge Cauldrons
accept All Along the Watchtowers | Commander Ashlam Valorfist.
turnin The Scourge Cauldrons | High Priestess MacDonnell.
accept Target: Felstone Field
turnin A Plague Upon Thee
accept 5904 A Plague Upon Thee
turnin The Wildlife Suffers Too
accept 4985 The Wildlife Suffers Too
complete Target: Felstone Field | Kill Cauldron Lord Bilemaw at the Felstone Field cauldron for the key.
turnin Target: Felstone Field | Use the key on the cauldron.
accept 5217 Return to Chillwind Camp
complete All Along the Watchtowers | Mark the three watchtowers in Andorhal with the torch.
accept A Matter of Time | Chromie in the ruined inn at Andorhal.
complete A Matter of Time | Use the Temporal Displacer by the silos in Andorhal and kill the Temporal Parasites that appear.
turnin A Matter of Time
accept Counting Out Time
complete Counting Out Time | Andorhal Watches from the small lockboxes in the Andorhal houses.
turnin Counting Out Time
turnin 5217 Return to Chillwind Camp | High Priestess MacDonnell.
turnin All Along the Watchtowers | Commander Ashlam Valorfist.
accept Target: Dalson's Tears
complete Target: Dalson's Tears | Cauldron Lord Malvinious at the Dalson's Tears cauldron drops the key.
turnin Target: Dalson's Tears
accept 5220 Return to Chillwind Camp
accept Mrs. Dalson's Diary [optional] | The diary in the Dalson farmhouse.
turnin Mrs. Dalson's Diary [optional]
accept 5060 Locked Away | The locked cabinet in the farmhouse.
complete 5060 Locked Away | Farmer Dalson, upstairs in the barn, drops the cabinet key.
turnin 5060 Locked Away
complete 4985 The Wildlife Suffers Too | Diseased Grizzlies in the hills east of the farms.
turnin 5220 Return to Chillwind Camp
accept Target: Writhing Haunt
turnin 4985 The Wildlife Suffers Too | Mulgris Deepriver.
complete Target: Writhing Haunt | Cauldron Lord Razarch at the Writhing Haunt cauldron.
turnin Target: Writhing Haunt
accept 5223 Return to Chillwind Camp
complete 5904 A Plague Upon Thee | Termite barrels at the Northridge Lumber Camp.
turnin 5223 Return to Chillwind Camp
accept Target: Gahrron's Withering
turnin 5904 A Plague Upon Thee
complete Target: Gahrron's Withering | Cauldron Lord Soulwrath at the Gahrron's Withering cauldron, east.
turnin Target: Gahrron's Withering
accept 5226 Return to Chillwind Camp
turnin 5226 Return to Chillwind Camp
accept Mission Accomplished!
turnin Mission Accomplished! | Commander Ashlam Valorfist.
complete Unfinished Business | Scarlet Medics and Hunters at the Northridge Lumber Camp.
turnin Unfinished Business
accept 6023 Unfinished Business
complete 6023 Unfinished Business | Huntsman Radley and Cavalier Durgen at Hearthglen.
turnin 6023 Unfinished Business
accept 6025 Unfinished Business
complete 6025 Unfinished Business
turnin 6025 Unfinished Business
level 57
train
note Next: the Eastern Plaguelands, east along the Thondroril River.
